## 📖 Surah 111 (Surah Al-Lahab / Tabbat Yada) se Related Hadith

**(Roman Urdu – Sahih Bukhari & Sahih Muslim)**

### 1. Surah Al-Lahab nazil hone ka waqia

**Hadith (Roman Urdu):**
Hazrat Ibn Abbas (RA) riwayat karte hain:

“Jab ayat nazil hui: *‘Wa anzir asheerataka al-aqrabeen’* (apne qareebi rishtedaron ko darao), to Nabi ﷺ Safa pahadi par chadhe aur Quraysh ko pukara. Jab sab jama ho gaye, aap ﷺ ne unko Allah ke azaab se daraya. Is par Abu Lahab ne kaha:
‘Tabban laka! Kya tum ne humein isi liye bulaya hai?’
Is par Allah ne nazil farmaya:
‘Tabbat yada abi Lahabin wa tabb…’ (Surah 111).”

**Reference:**
Sahih al-Bukhari – Hadith 4770
Sahih Muslim – Hadith 208

---

## 🧠 Samajh (Roman Urdu)

* Abu Lahab Nabi ﷺ ka chacha tha lekin **Islam ka sakht dushman** tha
* Us ne Nabi ﷺ ko insult kiya aur dawat ko reject kiya
* Allah ne foran us ke bare mein **poori surah nazil** kar di
* Yeh Surah batati hai ke **nasab (family relation)** se najat nahi milti
* Sirf **imaan aur amal** se najat milti hai

---

## 🌿 Surah 111 ka Main Message

* Abu Lahab ki daulat usko bachana nahi saki
* Uski biwi bhi burai mein saath thi
* Dono ke liye azaab ka zikr hai
* Islam mein **status nahi, imaan matter karta hai**

---

## ✍️ Reflection

* Kya main haq sun kar accept karta/karti hoon?
* Kya main deen ki baat ko ignore karta/karti hoon?
* Kya meri daulat ya status par ghuroor hai?

