2. Abu Lahab ka azaab (Monday ko halka)

Urwah (RA) se riwayat hai:

“Abu Lahab ko uski maut ke baad khwab mein dekha gaya. Us se poocha gaya kya mila? Us ne kaha: Tumhare baad koi bhalaai nahi mili, siwaye is ke ke mujhe har Monday thoda pani diya jata hai. Yeh is liye ke maine Nabi ﷺ ki paidaish ki khushi mein apni laundi Thuwaiba ko azad kiya tha.”

Reference:
Sahih al-Bukhari 5101

Samajh
Abu Lahab kafir tha phir bhi ek chhoti khushi par kuch halka azaab
Is se pata chalta hai Nabi ﷺ se muhabbat ki ahmiyat
Lekin phir bhi Surah 111 ke mutabiq uska final anjaam azaab hi hai

---
3. Qareebi rishtedaron ko dawat dena

Hazrat Abu Hurairah (RA) riwayat karte hain:

“Jab yeh ayat nazil hui ‘Apne qareebi rishtedaron ko darao’, to Nabi ﷺ ne Quraysh ko bulaya aur farmaya: ‘Ae Bani Abd Manaf! Ae Bani Abd al-Muttalib! Main tumhe Allah ke azaab se nahi bacha sakta.’”

Reference:
Sahih al-Bukhari 2753
Sahih Muslim 206

Samajh
Abu Lahab bhi isi qabeelay mein tha
Rishtedari hone ke bawajood imaan zaroori hai
Surah 111 ka message: family relation najat nahi deta
